
' blNative - just the bridge to native/boshlib.cpp, which contains the common
' C++ includes and convertBBString / convertBBStringToWide.
'
' Why a module for a single line: transcc does NOT deduplicate native file
' Imports, so importing "native/boshlib.cpp" from two different modules would
' emit it twice in the generated main.cpp -> redefinition error. Cerberus
' module Imports are deduplicated instead, so every module that needs the
' helpers just imports this one.
'
' It must be imported BEFORE the .cpp files that need it: the Imports at the
' top of each file that uses them guarantee this.

Import "native/boshlib.cpp"
